{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>The JoyCare</i> \u2013 an urban exploration horror game set in the ruins of an abandoned daycare center. What was once a place of laughter and innocence is now nothing but echoes and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a curious soul drawn to uncover the truth behind the daycare's closure\u2026 but you're not alone. Something else roams the halls \u2014 Jacky Joke, a forgotten mascot turned monster, still guards his playground. But he\u2019s not your only concern. The Misery Master, blinded and twisted by betrayal, lurks in the darkness, hunting through sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and uncover a disturbing story buried beneath toys, murals, and blood-stained secrets. Will you escape the grasp of your worst childhood nightmare?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I Played The Game!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673220/8f1a99e74c230387895d838072fe9cea2ff33137.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673220?t=1752786089","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673220?t=1752786089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673220/cf6f0193cba7aca1f06112065b4fbf163db7e321/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752786089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673220/cf6f0193cba7aca1f06112065b4fbf163db7e321/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752786089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>The JoyCare</i> \u2013 an urban exploration horror game set in the ruins of an abandoned daycare center. What was once a place of laughter and innocence is now nothing but echoes and shadows.</p><p